"color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["cattion_tpye:提供多种生成模式，以满足不同的需求，Descriptive Caption 和 Straightforward 是最有用的，其他模式很有趣，但不太稳定。\n\n\n我们一起来了解下：\nDescriptive Caption 以正式或随意的语气为图像编写描述性标题\nStraightforward Caption 比 Descriptive 更简洁、客观的风格。\nStable Diffusion Prompt 尝试模仿用户通常编写Stable Diffusion 提示的方式，混合使用自然语言和类似 booru 的标签。\nMidJourney 类似于 Training Prompt 模式，但更像MidJourney 提示。\nDanbooru tag list 写入镜像的 Danbooru 标签列表。\ne621 tag list 写入镜像的 e621 标签列表。\nRule34 tag list 写入镜像的 Rule34 标签列表。\nBooru-Like Tag List 类似于 Booru Tag List 模式，但会在 boorus 使用的严格标签列表之外写入。\nArt Critic Analysis 像艺术评论家一样撰写图像分析。Product Listing 为图像编写 Product Listing 样式的标题。Social Media Post 为图片撰写适合社交媒体帖子的标题。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [313.03009033203125, 593.2564697265625], "pos": [1046.9620361328125, -492.88714599609375], "id": 31, "properties": {}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "translation", "links": [33], "label": "translation", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "translation"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1535.798583984375, -474.7624816894531], "widgets_values": ["", 978, "randomize", "force_chinese"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 32, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 26, "type": "RH_Translator", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "RH_Translator"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [27, 31, 36], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [445.2890930175781, 668.9877319335938], "pos": [-1664.9385986328125, 244.97329711914062], "widgets_values": ["fd1555b873eead77cf442683d3131f54d48125d6d2f4694093e385185cdba92c.png", "image", ""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [315, 58], "pos": [-1226.1812744140625, -390.5245056152344]